# placeRAG

A lightweight Retrieval-Augmented Generation (RAG) chatbot built from scratch in Python.

## Goals

- No LangChain
- Local LLM via Ollama
- Streamlit UI
- FAISS vector search
- Support for PDFs (and later PPTX/DOCX)
- Modular architecture
